Files: third_party/svxconnect-cli/*
Copyright: 2026 Diëlectricum BV
License: Expat
Comment:
 The SVXConnect-CLI core, vendored into the source package and compiled into
 this binary as a static library. It is a submodule in git; submodules do not
 survive dpkg-source, so it ships in the .orig tarball. See
 debian/README.source.

Files: third_party/svxconnect-cli/third_party/miniaudio.h
Copyright: 2026 David Reid
License: Unlicense or MIT-0
Comment:
 miniaudio is dual licensed, public domain (Unlicense) or MIT-0 at the user's
 option. This package takes it under MIT-0.
 .
 miniaudio does not link the system audio libraries: it dlopen()s
 libasound.so.2 and libpulse.so.0 at runtime. Neither is a build dependency and
 neither is distributed here. That is also why dpkg-shlibdeps cannot detect
 them, and why debian/control names libasound2 by hand — without it the package
 installs cleanly on a minimal system and then has no audio at all.

Files: data/hicolor/*/apps/SVXConnect.png data/SVXConnect.png
Copyright: 2026 Diëlectricum BV
License: Expat
Comment:
 The application icon, rendered from the artwork used by the macOS SVXConnect
 application.

